msgid ""
"`calculateSqr` is a simple interface to the actual switching function and "
"takes the squared distance and prepares it for the actual rational function "
"(by precalculating $\\left(\\frac{ r }{ r_0 }\\right)$). It is a rewriting "
"of the `PLMD::SwitchingFunction::calculateSqr` method as a `__device__` "
"function:"
msgstr ""

